      398.77,
      540.0,
      493.84
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by thisOrder, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1448/27 of June 09, 2006 (as lastamended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2002/32 of January 18, 2017), which specifies the Facultiesand the Departments of the University of Colombo, Sri Lanka, which is deemed by virtue of the provisions of Section 139of the aforesaid Act, to be a University established under Section 21 of the said Act, by the substitution for the entry \u201d13.Department of Psychological Medicine\u201d appearing in Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item \u201cFacultyof Medicine\u201d appearing in Column I of the Schedule of the following entry :-",
